  quorum -.->|only these three store locations| permanent
  limits["SCALE RULES · 20 regions ≠ every database in 20 regions<br/>Database placement stays immutable; RF=2 in each selected region<br/>New regions do not join global R3; separate regional R3 needs at least 3 eligible hosts<br/>GRU / NATS outage pauses new control mutations; admitted data plane keeps serving<br/>10- and 20-region estates are design targets, not launch qualification evidence"]:::note
